{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53161","headline":"五言秋夜南间寺江尚院翫月一首 · 陈羽","name":"五言秋夜南间寺江尚院翫月一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圆月吐青[□]，萧寥天宇宽。\n凝光与空[□]，虚寂两无端。\n露重草衣湿，[□□]竹泉寒。\n欲持高洁意，长此共林峦。\n（均见日本藏唐抄本《唐诗卷》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}